development.question_text:
The diagram shows the curve $y = e^{x}$ and the tangent to the curve at the point $P$ where the curve crosses the $y$-axis.
The tangent meets the $x$-axis at $A$, and $O$ is the origin.
Find the equation of the tangent and the area of $\triangle OAP$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (-2.9,0) -- (2.1,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-1.3) -- (0,5.4) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick, <->, domain=-2.5:1.6, smooth, samples=80, variable=\x] plot ({\x},{exp(\x)});
\node[left] at (1.42,4.5) {$y=e^{x}$};
\draw (-1.9,-0.9) -- (1.7,2.7);
\node[below right] at (1.2,2.2) {tangent};
\fill (0,1) circle (2pt);
\node[above left] at (0,1) {$P$};
\fill (-1,0) circle (2pt);
\node[below left] at (-1,0) {$A$};
\node[below right] at (0,0) {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The diagram shows the curve $y = e^{2x}$ and the normal to the curve at the point $P$ where the curve crosses the $y$-axis.
The normal meets the $x$-axis at $B$.
Find the coordinates of $B$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (-2.2,0) -- (3.4,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-1.0) -- (0,5.2) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick, <->, domain=-1.6:0.78, smooth, samples=80, variable=\x] plot ({\x},{exp(2*\x)});
\node[right] at (0.85,4.4) {$y=e^{2x}$};
\draw (-0.8,1.4) -- (2.6,-0.3);
\node[below] at (2.35,-0.18) {normal};
\fill (0,1) circle (2pt);
\node[above left] at (0,1) {$P$};
\fill (2,0) circle (2pt);
\node[above right] at (2,0) {$B$};
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

mastery.question_text:
The diagram shows the curve $y = \ln x$ and the tangent to the curve drawn from the origin $O$, touching the curve at $P$.
Find the coordinates of $P$ and the equation of the tangent.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (-0.7,0) -- (5.8,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-1.9) -- (0,2.5) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick, <->, domain=0.25:4.6, smooth, samples=100, variable=\x] plot ({\x},{ln(\x)});
\node[below right] at (4.3,1.30) {$y=\ln x$};
\draw (0,0) -- (5.0,1.8394);
\node[above left] at (3.9,1.4348) {tangent};
\fill (2.718,1) circle (2pt);
\node[above left] at (2.718,1) {$P$};
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
